WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:05.789
Snooks: [i@Ar-ooo!@i]

2
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.601
Banjo: [i@Woof!@i]

3
00:00:07.602 --> 00:00:10.821
Chatter: Bad boy! Go to your room!

4
00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:14.923
Mack: What's going on?

5
00:00:14.924 --> 00:00:17.154
Ben: Um . . .

6
00:00:17.155 --> 00:00:19.988
Theo: Frankie jumped in the pond!

7
00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:24.848
Sarah: Pepper and Chatter are in a tree!

8
00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:29.280
Mack: Huh? I thought your pets would behave well.

9
00:00:29.281 --> 00:00:35.103
Mack: Here, let me have that net.

10
00:00:35.104 --> 00:00:40.765
Theo: Frankie! Thank you for rescuing him, Mack.

11
00:00:40.766 --> 00:00:48.432
Sarah: Whew! Pepper is finally climbing down.

12
00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:52.771
Kyle: See, Snooks? Banjo likes you.

13
00:00:52.772 --> 00:00:58.024
Skyler: Chatter is still up in the tree.

14
00:00:58.025 --> 00:01:03.146
Skyler: Come, Chatter. You can have some cake later.

15
00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:11.710
Skyler: Good boy. Now back in your cage!

16
00:01:11.711 --> 00:01:14.652
Miss Brook: Time for the party!

17
00:01:14.653 --> 00:01:19.568
Miss Brook: Look at my cake. It turned out fine.

18
00:01:19.569 --> 00:01:23.576
Mack: These campers look too sad for a party.

19
00:01:23.577 --> 00:01:28.746
Skyler: We wanted to help you on the last day.

20
00:01:28.747 --> 00:01:32.788
Sarah: And we wanted to show off our pets.

21
00:01:32.789 --> 00:01:35.931
Theo: But they were awful!

22
00:01:35.932 --> 00:01:40.424
Miss Brook: Hmm . . . maybe it's time for an activity.

23
00:01:40.425 --> 00:01:46.872
Miss Brook: A pet show!

24
00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:55.494
Theo: Frankie can jump through a hoop.

25
00:01:55.495 --> 00:02:02.515
Skyler: Chatter says funny things.

26
00:02:02.516 --> 00:02:08.136
Riley: Snooks likes to howl.

27
00:02:08.137 --> 00:02:15.449
Ben: Speedy can hide inside his shell.

28
00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:20.746
Sarah: Pepper can sing.

29
00:02:20.747 --> 00:02:30.641
Kyle: Roll over, Banjo!

30
00:02:30.642 --> 00:02:36.822
Mack: Nice pets, kids. They listen very well.

31
00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.300
Miss Brook: We're going to miss you campers.

32
00:02:39.301 --> 00:02:40.743
Miss Brook: Right, Mack?

33
00:02:40.744 --> 00:02:46.065
Mack: Um . . . well, yes. A little bit.

34
00:02:46.066 --> 00:02:50.406
Theo: Don't worry, Mack. We'll come back to visit!

35
00:02:50.407 --> 00:02:54.289
Ben: With our pets. See how quiet they can be?

36
00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:58.955
Mack: Yep, when they're sleeping!

37
00:02:58.956 --> 00:03:08.031
Chatter: Party's over! Time to go!

